{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>美國博彩協會委託Qualtrics開展的一項民意調查顯示，82%的美國受訪者跨越黨派分歧，認為預測市場應當被作為博彩產品而非金融產品進行監管。調查還發現，75%的受訪者認為，通過預測市場買賣與體育賽事相關的事件合約，與通過體育博彩平台下注沒有區別。</p>\n<h2>最新資訊</h2>\n<h2>編輯精選</h2>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>熱門評論</h3>\n<h3>相關文章</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>Top 10</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:42:11.615986+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:55:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:58:16.750532+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T13:35:32.057020+00:00","content_hash":"d642157009543a6693db700ff11c15cfb06e4cc80b2c72811224899c93fdce02","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}